# Build outputs and dependencies are produced inside the image, never copied into it.
# Copying bin/ and obj/ in is not just slow — a host build for a different RID lands in the
# image and shadows the one the Dockerfile just produced.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

artifacts/
scripts/
**/*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.user
**/TestResults/
